# TEMPORARY V2-H PROOF SUPPORT.
# Non-gatherable structural shell. Deliberately no logs or planks - both are gather candidates and
# would stop the scan ever reporting NO_CANDIDATES_IN_RADIUS. Smooth stone is not cobblestone, so it
# is not a cobble candidate either.
fill ~-16 ~-1 ~-16 ~16 ~-1 ~16 smooth_stone
fill ~-16 ~0 ~-16 ~16 ~5 ~16 air
setblock ~ ~1 ~ bell
setblock ~2 ~ ~ smithing_table
setblock ~-2 ~ ~ fletching_table
setblock ~0 ~ ~3 red_bed
